1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,650
I slept four hours. But I feel ready to make eight hours of questionable decisions.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:12,550
Sleep supports attention, memory and emotional well-being. It is maintenance time, not wasted time.

3
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:18,390
My brain's night staff keep arriving while I am watching one last video. They have formed a union.

4
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:28,700
Children aged six to twelve generally need nine to twelve hours. Teenagers need eight to ten. Adults aged eighteen to sixty generally need at least seven.

5
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:32,580
So a child is not an adult with a smaller charging cable.

6
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:41,280
Protect enough sleep time and keep bedtime and waking time consistent. Regular trouble sleeping deserves attention from a healthcare professional.

7
00:00:41,530 --> 00:00:45,990
Tonight, one last video will have an actual definition of last.